    </files>
    <patterns>
      <pattern name="Enum-driven state transitions with exhaustive switch" location="src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Jobs/">Existing pattern for exception → job-status transitions; extend the shape for FailureClass.</pattern>
      <pattern name="App Insights audit event" location="src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/">TelemetryClient.TrackEvent with custom properties (actor tid, reason); copy for QuarantineCleared event.</pattern>
    </patterns>
  </knowledge>

  <steps mode="directional">
    <step order="0" name="Rigor + load">Emit RIGOR LEVEL (FULL). Load spec.md FR-24 + design.md §4C state-transition table + this project's CLAUDE.md.</step>
    <step order="1" name="Inventory">Read design.md §4C state-transition table verbatim; author a matching test-case list before code.</step>
    <step order="2" name="Enum + classifier">Author FailureClass enum + IFailureClassifier + FailureClassifier implementation mapping handler outcomes/exceptions to classes.</step>
    <step order="3" name="Transition wire">Modify StateReconcilerService (from task 058) to invoke IFailureClassifier on handler outcome + apply the resulting Cosmos state transition per §4C table.</step>
    <step order="4" name="Quarantine block">Integrate with task 059 CustomerRunGuard — a customer with a Quarantined run cannot start a new run; TryAcquireAsync returns Conflict with a Quarantined-specific reason code.</step>
    <step order="5" name="Clear service">Author QuarantineClearService — verify run in Quarantined state, transition to Failed (post-quarantine), release CustomerRunGuard, audit-log to App Insights with actor tid + reason.</step>
    <step order="6" name="Endpoint wire">Wire POST /api/runs/{id}/clear-quarantine (task 057) to QuarantineClearService — 400 if reason missing, 404 if run not found, 409 if run not in Quarantined state, 200 on success.</step>
    <step order="7" name="Tests">Author RollbackTransitions.Tests.cs: for each of 4 classes, verify handler outcome → Cosmos state transition matches §4C table. QuarantineClearService: happy + negative (wrong-state, missing-reason, unauthorized).</step>
    <step order="8" name="Verify">dotnet build + dotnet test = green; dotnet format; zero analyzer warnings.</step>
    <step order="9" name="Index update">Update TASK-INDEX.md: task 061 → ✅.</step>
    <step order="10" name="Deviations">Document any deviation in projects/customer-provisioning-orchestration-r1/notes/.</step>
  </steps>

  <tools>
    <tool name="dotnet">Build and test the L2 control-plane project</tool>
    <tool name="terminal">Run shell commands</tool>
